          "value": "\n<div class=\"w-mock__bar\"><span class=\"w-mock__dots\"><span class=\"w-mock__dot\"></span><span class=\"w-mock__dot w-mock__dot--yellow\"></span><span class=\"w-mock__dot w-mock__dot--green\"></span></span><span class=\"w-mock__title\">app.pxpace.com — Create your account</span></div>\n<div class=\"w-mock__row\"><span class=\"w-mock__icon\"></span><span class=\"w-mock__name\">Full name<span class=\"w-mock__meta\">Jane Cooper</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"w-mock__row\"><span class=\"w-mock__icon\"></span><span class=\"w-mock__name\">Email<span class=\"w-mock__meta\">jane@studio.dev</span></span><span class=\"w-pill w-pill--success\">Verified</span></div>\n<div class=\"w-mock__row\"><span class=\"w-mock__icon\"></span><span class=\"w-mock__name\">Password<span class=\"w-mock__meta\">••••••••••••••</span></span><span class=\"w-pill w-pill--success\">Strong</span></div>\n<div class=\"w-mock__row\"><span class=\"w-chip\">Create account</span><span class=\"w-mock__skeleton w-mock__skeleton--long\"></span></div>\n"
        },
        {
