                      "html": "Brand colours carry Bricks-generated shades (<code class=\"w-ds-code\">-l-1…4</code> / <code class=\"w-ds-code\">-d-1…4</code>). Components never read a hex: they read Theme roles (<code class=\"w-ds-code\">--bg-*</code>, <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--text-*</code>, <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--border-*</code>). Every role has a light and a dark value — use the switch in the header; values below update live. Dark bands re-point roles with <code class=\"w-ds-code\">data-surface</code>.",
