                      ],
                      "html": "Every file in <code class=\"w-ds-code\">fonts/</code> is a static weight subset to English, French, German, Croatian and Vietnamese. Funnel Display and Instrument Serif ship without Vietnamese upstream; <code class=\"w-ds-code\">fonts/build_fonts.py</code> adds dấu hỏi, dấu nặng and the móc of ơ/ư and composes the 96 missing Vietnamese letters plus ₫ (all 134 letters now present).",
