                      "classes": [
                        "w-text-m"
                      ],
                      "html": "Steps up to <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--space-s</code> are fixed (4–16 px); from <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--space-m</code> they are clamps over 320 → 1440 px and reach their full values at 1440. Container = <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--max-screen-width</code> 1440 px; framed sections cap their container at <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--layout-frame</code> 1200 px, the rails sit on that frame and the 20 px gutter is the section's <code class=\"w-ds-code\">--layout-margin</code>.",
