                        "features": "<li class=\"w-card-plan__feature\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-card-plan__check\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.33 8l3.33 3.33 6.67-6.66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.33\"></path></svg>Fully managed server setup</li><li class=\"w-card-plan__feature\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-card-plan__check\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.33 8l3.33 3.33 6.67-6.66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.33\"></path></svg>Optimized hosting stack</li><li class=\"w-card-plan__feature\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-card-plan__check\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.33 8l3.33 3.33 6.67-6.66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.33\"></path></svg>Daily automated backups</li><li class=\"w-card-plan__feature\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-card-plan__check\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.33 8l3.33 3.33 6.67-6.66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.33\"></path></svg>Free SSL and renewal</li><li class=\"w-card-plan__feature\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-card-plan__check\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.33 8l3.33 3.33 6.67-6.66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.33\"></path></svg>Support from expert engineers</li>"
